{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian|st=friendly,neutral",{"They said it was handled, then they said nothing at all"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"They promised help, we're still waiting"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"The government? They couldn't pave a road - why would they stop this?"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'd like to believe someone's in charge, I just don't know who"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral",{"Chain of command went silent on the fourth - we're improvising"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"I don't know, nobody tells us shit"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral",{"Command is operational, that's all I'm permitted to say","Chain of command's still up, I just couldn't tell you where the top of it is anymore"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"No comment"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=outlaw|st=friendly,neutral",{"Never trusted them before, not starting now"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=raider|st=friendly,neutral",{"Government? Ha, we're the government now"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral",{"They never did nothing for us - why start?"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral",{"Government can kiss my tailpipe","We never paid the government much mind, nice to see they finally returned the favor"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Government is a marketplace, right now it's closed"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"They locked me up, now they're nowhere - funny","Government put me in a cage for eleven years, now the government's gone - you do the math"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Washington? Frankfort? they're gone, or hiding, or on vacation, I don't know!","The governor said something on TV, \"stay calm,\" then the signal died, and I haven't seen him since","No one's in charge, not anymore, we're all just... figuring it out","The president was supposed to give a speech, that was Saturday, I watched the whole empty podium","Somebody's got to be doing something, right? somebody, somewhere, in some office, tell me somebody is","They told us to wait, and they'd tell us what to do, and I'm still waiting","Gone, they're gone, and so's the mail, and the garbage truck, and the water bill, God, I miss the water bill","They abandoned us, that's what I think, they locked the door and left us outside"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Government is a word that belongs to the old world, out here there's only whoever's got a gun","There's no government, there's a few officers, a few sheriffs, a few folks wearing a badge they found","Might still be bureaucrats in some bunker in Virginia... drinking coffee, filing reports","They haven't sent anything in weeks, no aid, no word, no goodbye","Politicians always run first, this time they were just faster than usual","I'd say the government fell the day the power did, and nobody told the government","Government's us now, whoever's still standing and willing to share"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"They said federal help is on the way, I keep repeating it, \"on the way\"","The state sent out a statement, an official statement, it said \"limited outbreak,\" LIMITED!"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Government? Ha! don't make me laugh, it's a bad joke","What's it to you? you want to file a complaint?","I'm not discussing politics with a stranger","Don't mention the government to me","I don't trust officials","You look like you'd know more about that than me - you with them? Keep your distance"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=militia",{"Orders stopped coming down on the fourth day, I haven't heard from the chain of command since","The Guard answers to the governor... the governor answers to Washington -- and nobody answers"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=rescue_medical",{"Public health department sent one memo, \"isolate the sick,\" that's it, then no one picked up the phone","The state health commissioner is a decent man, and he's probably dead, or buried in paperwork"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=rescue_clergy",{"Render unto Caesar, the saying goes, but Caesar has left the building","Our governor attended a prayer service last month, I wonder if he's still praying"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Dispatch is the last government I talk to, and they've gone silent"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=civilian_loner",{"Never trusted 'em before, don't need 'em now"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Washington's a long way off..","The governor said something on the radio the first day","There was a man in a suit at the checkpoint","I think they've forgotten us","If there's a government, it's hiding","I paid taxes for thirty years","My congressman never returned my call","They told us to stay in our homes","The government made us a promise","I don't think anyone's in charge"},false,false,{[1]={{t="and a long time ago",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="\"everything's under control\"",afterMs=3200},{t="I haven't heard from him since",afterMs=3000}},[3]={{t="he said, \"I'm from the government, and I'm here to help\"",afterMs=3500},{t="I laughed out loud",afterMs=3000}},[4]={{t="or they're hoping we'll forget them",afterMs=3200}},[5]={{t="behind a desk, behind a gun, behind a sign saying \"closed\"",afterMs=3500}},[6]={{t="I want a refund",afterMs=3200}},[7]={{t="and now neither do I",afterMs=3500}},[8]={{t="then they locked the doors from outside",afterMs=3200}},[9]={{t="and a promise is only as good as who made it",afterMs=3500}},[10]={{t="and that's the scariest thing I've said today",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"The government? They're on vacation","If I find the president, I'm going to ask for a raise, ha!","The government's in a meeting"},false,false,{[1]={{t="a very long one",afterMs=3200},{t="with no forwarding address",afterMs=2800}},[3]={{t="has been for a while",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"It's us now"},false,false,{[1]={{t="you and me and everyone like us",afterMs=3200},{t="we're the government",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"They'll announce something, they have to, a president always speaks","The governor's on TV every hour, \"remain calm\""},false,false,{[2]={{t="I keep wondering how calm he is",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,14",{"No speech, no statement, no nothing","Washington's gone quiet"},false,false,{[1]={{t="it's the silence that scares me",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="that tells you something",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=15,99999",{"There is no government","We're our own country now"},false,false,{[1]={{t="there are people, and there are rules, and that's all",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"Does anybody know where they are? Is anyone in charge?!"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"I voted my whole life"},false,false,{[1]={{t="for this?",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"Useless -- every one of them, useless and gone!"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Government? Ha! They sealed the roads and left us in here to die, and you want me to say something nice?","What government, {g:pal|lady}, I haven't seen a suit since Friday, and nobody's missing them","They're in some bunker eating steak right now, I'd bet my last bullet on it","The government's under its desk with the lights off, and I'd do the same","Last thing the government did was lock us in, so far it's the best thing they ever did for me","They let this county burn to save their own ass, I don't owe them a damn thing","Frankfort, Washington, whatever, nobody's picking up, nobody's coming, so I'm the government now","I used to pay taxes to those bastards, now I'm collecting, how's that for justice?"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Don't you say that word to me, they got us into this and I'm not feeling polite about it!","You want the government? Look at my hand, this is what's in charge now"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Honestly? I don't even know if they're alive, I haven't heard one word and it's scaring the shit out of me","I keep waiting for a truck full of guys in suits to show up and fix this, and I know that's stupid","Somebody must be doing something... right? Please tell me somebody's doing something"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=raider_boss,gang_boss,biker_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"Government is a habit, and the habit just died, I intend to be the next one"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Government never did nothing for my block before, so why start now?","They sealed us in and bounced, that's the government for you","Politicians only show up to our neighborhood when there's cameras, I don't see any cameras","Mayor's probably in Lexington eating fried chicken while we're out here, as God is my witness","You think Washington cares about West End? They never did, and now they REALLY don't","They told us to stay inside, stay calm, stay put, and I'm gonna be honest, that's how my aunt died","Government's a joke, {g:man|lady}, the only law around here is us"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Government? I AM the government on this block, you got a problem with that?"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"I heard Washington's still up, still talking about us, but nobody's coming here, that's for damn sure","Man, I hope somebody's out there fighting for us, I really do, I'm tired of fighting alone"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"They lock the county, they run for the hills, same as ever","Politicians were always the first ones out the door, I just didn't expect them to lock it behind them","Never trusted 'em before, why would I start now?","After Waco I figured the feds would shoot first and ask later, never figured the dead would be the exception","Government owes me a pension, a bike payment, and about six apologies"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Fuck the government, fuck every last one of them, you hear me?!"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=club|st=friendly",{"They might be trying to help, {g:brother|sister}, but we haven't seen any proof of it","I'd love to be wrong about them, honest to God, but I've been burned before"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"The government is, as always, a day late and a dollar short","Officials have been quiet, which tells me everything I need to know","Governments exist to protect property, and I have yet to see anyone protecting mine","Do you know how many men in this county are waiting on a phone call from Frankfort? None of them is getting it","Every institution has a breaking point, and ours just passed it"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=crime|st=hostile",{"That's a naive question, and you should not ask naive questions of people like me"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I hope they find a solution soon, for everyone's sake, mine included"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"They locked me up, they locked everybody up, then they forgot about us, that's the government","No government is gonna help us, we're on our own, always were, honestly","The state fed me for six years and I hated every bite, now I'd kill for one meal of it","Last I heard the warden called Frankfort for help, he got a busy signal, then he got bit"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Don't talk to me about authority, I've had enough authority to last me ten lifetimes!"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"I don't trust them, never have, but I'd turn myself in if it meant a hot meal and a bed"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Out of sight, out of mind, that's how they treat this county, always have","Doubt they're coming, they've got bigger problems than a few hollers in Kentucky","After what happened at Waco I don't want the feds anywhere near me, even if they're the only ones left","I know a county judge, he's hiding in his cellar, so that's about the extent of our government","Old man in Elizabethtown says it's all a plot, and honestly, I'm starting to wonder"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"I hear the president's still alive, whatever good that does us"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"They gave us orders and then the orders stopped, and then the officers stopped, that's all I know about the government"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=deserter|st=friendly",{"They told us help was coming, I believed them for four days"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Official channels have been silent for days, and I don't like it any more than you do","We're operating without contact from the state, essentially on our own","The governor's office issued an evacuation order early on, then nothing, not a word since","I took an oath, and I'm keeping it, but I wish someone would tell me who I'm keeping it to","Dispatch went quiet on the third night and I've been giving my own orders ever since"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Speculation isn't helpful, please keep it to yourself"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=law|st=friendly",{"They're doing what they can, I hope, I really do... I keep telling the guys that","I've got friends in the state police, and I haven't heard from a single one, so who knows"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"Frankfort went dark on the third day and I haven't heard a peep since","The county judge ran for Louisville with his family, I don't blame him, but I do remember"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Orders come from Fort Knox command, beyond that I don't know","Chain of command is intact as far as I know","I follow orders, I don't ask where they come from"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Not authorized to discuss, civilian"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=military|st=friendly",{"I believe they're working on it, I really do... I have to"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=soldier_nco|st=neutral,careful",{"Chain of command has gone quiet, I'll leave it at that"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"They said help was coming, they said it every day, now they don't say anything... I think they forgot about us"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=elite|st=neutral,careful",{"The government you're asking about stopped giving orders to people like me a long time ago"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=mercenary|st=neutral,careful",{"Governments change, money doesn't, and right now neither is showing up"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"We stopped waiting for Frankfort the day the phones went down","Government never did right by this county and it's not about to start","Used to complain about the county commissioners, now I'd kill for one with a working telephone","After Waco I wouldn't trust a federal man with my dog, never mind my family"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=militia|st=friendly",{"We hear things on the radio, sounds like somebody is organizing something, so there's hope"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,7",{"The President was on TV the first night talking about a situation - then nothing - you think he's okay?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,9",{"Frankfort's got to be doing something - the Governor wouldn't just leave a whole county, would he?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"I used to write my congressman about the potholes on our road - Lord, I'd give anything for potholes to be the problem"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family|st=friendly,neutral|day=8,9999",{"Government's a flag on a pole in front of a post office nobody opens - that's all it is now"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Washington drew a line around us on a map and walked off - that's your government","Last government anything I saw was a helicopter dropping leaflets saying stay indoors - paper's still blowing around Muldraugh"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"They're doing what they always do, deciding whether we're worth the money"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful|world=road",{"I'm not talking politics with a stranger in the middle of the road"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Government left, you ought to do the same"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Same place it was when they closed the mill, somewhere else, not answering"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|world=water",{"Union rep always said they'd sell us down the river - didn't figure he meant the Ohio"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=rescue|role=rescue_firefighter,rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"State emergency management called the station the first night to tell us to stand by - we're still standing by"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=rescue|role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"Governments are made of men, I pray for them too - it's a short prayer these days"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Last directive from Frankfort was maintain order and await the Guard - take that however you like"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=law|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"I swore an oath to a government I can't raise on the radio - I'm still keeping it - somebody should"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=law|role=law_sheriff|st=friendly,neutral",{"County government's me, two deputies and a judge-executive who won't open his front door - that's what's left"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"The government out here is whoever's holding this shotgun - keep walking"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=military|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral|day=5,9999",{"We get orders, they come from somewhere, whether anybody's signing them, I couldn't say"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=elite",{"Continuity of government is in place, you're not part of it"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=military,elite|st=careful,hostile",{"Not a topic for discussion - turn around"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=military|role=deserter|world=fence",{"Government's the reason there's a fence around you - go ask the fence"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=outlaw,raider,crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Ain't no government, ain't no taxes, ain't no parole officer, I'm not crying about it"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle,road",{"Government never came down my street except in a squad car - why would they start now?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"We're the government out here, and you're behind on your taxes"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"No laws left out here, and look at you, standing there"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"There was a number to call on the TV, I called it about nine hundred times"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=family|st=neutral|mood=funny",{"FEMA was supposed to be at the school, we drove out there - it's a school"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"County judge went to Frankfort on the seventh, that's the last anybody heard"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=rescue_medical|st=neutral",{"Public health called us twice on the fifth - nothing since, their line just rings"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=rescue_clergy|st=neutral",{"Government used to be a word that meant somebody answers - nobody answers"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"I file reports to an office that quit answering on the ninth - I still file 'em"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral",{"I'm the government in this county right now, and that should scare you"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"There's a chain of command, it's long and it's broke somewhere in the middle"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=elite_delta|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Somebody's still funding this, that's the only proof of government I've seen"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=club|st=neutral|mood=funny",{"Government showed up for the flood in '89, two weeks late with the wrong forms"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","role=raider_boss,gang_boss|tmp=predator|st=hostile|world=road",{"Government's whoever's holding the road, right now, that happens to be me"}},
{"ASK_GOVERNMENT","reg=civilian,worker|tmp=seasoned|st=hostile|world=road",{"They bulldozed the road out and told us stay indoors - that's your government"}},
